{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["犹大的罪和惩罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["犹大的罪是用铁笔、用金钢钻记录的，铭刻在他们的心版上和坛角上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他们的儿女记念他们高冈上、青翠树旁的坛和木偶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我田野的山哪，我必因你在四境之内所犯的罪，把你的货物、财宝，并邱坛当掠物交给仇敌；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["并且你因自己的罪必失去我所赐给你的产业。我也必使你在你所不认识的地上服事你的仇敌；因为你使我怒中起火，直烧到永远。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["训诲集"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倚靠人血肉的膀臂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中离弃耶和华的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那人有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他必像沙漠的杜松，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不见福乐来到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却要住旷野干旱之处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人居住的硷地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倚靠耶和华、以耶和华为可靠的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那人有福了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必像树栽于水旁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在河边扎根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"炎热来到，并不惧怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叶子仍必青翠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在干旱之年毫无挂虑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且结果不止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"人心比万物都诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坏到极处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能识透呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我—耶和华是鉴察人心、试验人肺腑的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要照各人所行的和他做事的结果报应他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"那不按正道得财的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像鹧鸪抱不是自己下的蛋；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了中年，那财都必离开他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他终久成为愚顽人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"我们的圣所是荣耀的宝座，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从太初安置在高处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华—以色列的盼望啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡离弃你的必致蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：离开我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的名字必写在土里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们离弃我这活水的泉源。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米求耶和华帮助"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，求你医治我，我便痊愈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救我，我便得救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你是我所赞美的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们对我说：耶和华的话在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫这话应验吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于我，那跟从你作牧人的职分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我并没有急忙离弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有想那灾殃的日子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是你知道的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我口中所出的言语都在你面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要使我因你惊恐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当灾祸的日子，你是我的避难所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那些逼迫我的蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不要使我蒙羞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们惊惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不要使我惊惶；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使灾祸的日子临到他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以加倍的毁坏毁坏他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["关于遵守安息日"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶和华对我如此说：「你去站在平民的门口，就是犹大君王出入的门，又站在耶路撒冷的各门口，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["对他们说：『你们这犹大君王和犹大众人，并耶路撒冷的一切居民，凡从这些门进入的都当听耶和华的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和华如此说：你们要谨慎，不要在安息日担什么担子进入耶路撒冷的各门；"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["也不要在安息日从家中担出担子去。无论何工都不可做，只要以安息日为圣日，正如我所吩咐你们列祖的。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["他们却不听从，不侧耳而听，竟硬着颈项不听，不受教训。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["耶和华说：「你们若留意听从我，在安息日不担什么担子进入这城的各门，只以安息日为圣日，在那日无论何工都不做；"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["那时就有坐大卫宝座的君王和首领，他们与犹大人，并耶路撒冷的居民，或坐车，或骑马，进入这城的各门，而且这城必存到永远。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["也必有人从犹大城邑和耶路撒冷四围的各处，从便雅悯地、高原、山地，并南地而来，都带燔祭、平安祭、素祭，和乳香，并感谢祭，到耶和华的殿去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["你们若不听从我，不以安息日为圣日，仍在安息日担担子，进入耶路撒冷的各门，我必在各门中点火；这火也必烧毁耶路撒冷的宫殿，不能熄灭。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}